  {"text": "The contradiction dissolves when interpreting “jointly assess” as evaluating self-awareness and spatial cognition in an integrated task, which benchmarks indeed lack.", "topic": "definition of jointly assess"},
  {"text": "UAV-DualCog is introduced precisely because prior benchmarks failed to combine self-awareness and spatial cognition, consistent with both A and B.", "topic": "UAV-DualCog motivation"}
